deep-research-report.md:229:| `LITERATURE-SUPPORTED PRINCIPLE` counterfactual credit 要明確 baseline／fixed background | Wolpert & Tumer, *Advances in Complex Systems*, 2001, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1142/S0219525901000188); Foerster et al., COMA, AAAI 2018, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1609/aaai.v32i1.11794). citeturn14search0turn12view6 | useful credit ≠ summed simultaneous exactness |
deep-research-report.md:231:| `LITERATURE-SUPPORTED PRINCIPLE` Shapley efficiency 適用於一個固定 coalition game | Lloyd Shapley, RAND P-295, 1952, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.7249/P0295). citeturn12view11 | 不推出 strategic/deployment potential |
