deep-research-report.md:233:| `LITERATURE-SUPPORTED PRINCIPLE` wireless potential 結果依賴特定 utility construction | Nie & Comaniciu, *Mobile Networks and Applications*, 2006, [DOI](https://doi.org/10.1007/s11036-006-0049-y). citeturn12view10 | 不能直接外推到 satellite LC-SRS/CSE |
