diff --git a/.scratch/beamwidth/spec.md b/.scratch/beamwidth/spec.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..7e7f65077719efa6c2ef31be61f11dff7f690c4a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.scratch/beamwidth/spec.md
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Beam half-power-angle diagnostic completion criterion
+
+`DIAGNOSTIC_NOT_CLAIM`.
+
+One unattended command must evaluate the same eight or more real anchors at
+each declared one-sided off-boresight half-power angle `1.66`, `2.40`, `3.32`,
+`4.50`, and `6.65` degrees. It must report pooled energy efficiency, served
+counts, oracle-over-unilateral coordination headroom, interference-limited
+share, and top-1 aggressor share for BASELINE, the converged iterated
+unilateral selector, and the bounded oracle set selector. The root report must
+also quote the retrievable primary source's equation and Table I entry, resolve
+the source convention by direct pattern evaluation, audit convention-coupled
+constants, and confirm that sealed engine files were unchanged.

